ame=\"spots available label\">\n                                        18 places left\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_96px] items-center gap-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"activity item\">\n                                    <div data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"activity info\">\n                                        <p class=\"text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#283A30]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"activity name\">\n                                            Reading Buddies\n                                        </p>\n                                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#68766D]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"activity details\">\n                                            Oct 7 · 1:00–4:00 · San Isidro Community Center\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-right text-[12px] font-medium text-[#365F48]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"spots available label\">\n                                        7 places left\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_96px] items-center gap-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"activity item\">\n                                    <div data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"activity info\">\n                                        <p class=\"text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#283A30]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"activity name\">\n                                            Campus Garden Day\n                                        </p>\n                                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#68766D]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"activity details\">\n                                            Oct 11 · 9:00–12:00 · North Quad Garden\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <span class=\"text-right text-[12px] font-medium text-[#365F48]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"spots available label\">\n                                        12 places left\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 border-t border-[#E9ECE7] pt-4 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"management footer links\">\n                                <a class=\"font-medium text-[#506258] underline decoration-[#C4CEC4] underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"certificates link\" href=\"#certificates\">\n                                    Certificates\n                                </a>\n                                <a class=\"font-medium text-[#506258] underline decoration-[#C4CEC4] underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"templates link\" href=\"#templates\">\n                                    Certificate templates\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                    </main>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n        </section>\n        <footer class=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-[#DCE2DA] pt-5 text-[13px] text-[#68766D]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4\" data-name=\"footer section\">\n            <span data-kid=\"1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"copyright notice text\">\n                Campus Connect · Student volunteer community\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"footer theme details\">\n                <span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#14695A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"palette color indicator\">\n                </span>\n                Newsreader + DM Sans · Green-led service palette\n            </span>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-10-03T16:31:20.069667+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-10-03T16:34:31.734857+00:00",
